{
  "Combat.GoblinBroodmother.Defeated.TheGoblinBroodmother": "The goblin broodmother is defeated! You find a bottle of succubi milk on her. That stuff is banned in Tel'Adre - and for good reason, but it might come in handy. You pocket the foul fluid for now."
  "Combat.GoblinBroodmother.Defeated.YouCouldUse": " You could use her for a quick, willing fuck to sate your lusts before continuing on. Do you?"
  "Combat.GoblinBroodmother.Drug.Absorbed": "\nThe liquid hits your shield and is harmlessly absorbed."
  "Combat.GoblinBroodmother.Drug.Dodge": "\nYou narrowly avoid the gush of alchemic fluids!"
  "Combat.GoblinBroodmother.Drug.Green": "\nThe greenish fluids splash over you, making you feel slimy and gross. Nausea plagues you immediately - you have been poisoned!"
  "Combat.GoblinBroodmother.Drug.Red": "\nThe red fluids hit you and instantly soak into your skin, disappearing. Your skin flushes and you feel warm. Oh no..."
  "Combat.GoblinBroodmother.Drug.Throw": "{0} uncorks a glass bottle full of {1} fluid and swings her arm, flinging a wave of fluid at you."
  "Combat.GoblinBroodmother.Tease.Display": " The display distracts you long enough to prevent you from taking advantage of her awkward pose, leaving you more than a little flushed."
}
